[{"code":"program_shape","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":27,"col":9},"end":{"line":27,"col":10}},"title":"PROGRAM SHAPE","message":"This hole shows markup the program holds as a value — in its model, a record or\na list — so its elements cannot be numbered when the program is built, and\n`browser-inline` has no renderer to hand markup it did not compile\n(`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.7; §5, class 3). Keep in the model the data\nthe markup shows, and write the markup in `view` or in a function `view` calls."},{"code":"program_shape","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":34,"col":47},"end":{"line":34,"col":48}},"title":"PROGRAM SHAPE","message":"This markup is a value the program holds, not part of a `view` written where it\nis shown, so its elements cannot be numbered when the program is built, and\n`browser-inline` has no renderer to hand markup it did not compile\n(`docs/design/browser-inline.md` §8.7; §5, class 3). Keep in the model the data\nthe markup shows, and write the markup in `view` or in a function `view` calls."}]
